---
layout: base.njk
title: Ashtabula County Polling Places & Precinct Lookup
description: Search the Ashtabula County polling-place directory and precinct assignments. Verify your personal Election Day location with the Ohio Secretary of State.
permalink: /polling-places/index.html
---
{% set directory = pollingPlaces %}
<article class="polling-page" data-polling-explorer>
  <nav class="polling-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Polling places</span></nav>
  <header class="polling-intro">
    <p class="polling-eyebrow">{{ directory.county }} · {{ directory.election }}</p>
    <h1>Find your polling place</h1>
    <p class="polling-lede">Search the county’s official precinct and Election Day polling-place directory. Then verify your personal assignment with the Ohio Secretary of State before you go.</p>
    <a class="polling-verify-button" href="https://voterlookup.ohiosos.gov/voterlookup.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verify your assigned polling place <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <p class="polling-privacy"><strong>Privacy:</strong> This page does not ask for or store your home address. Search stays in your browser. If you open a map or official lookup, your browser connects directly to that service.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="polling-source-notice" aria-labelledby="polling-freshness-heading">
    <span class="polling-notice-icon" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
    <div><h2 id="polling-freshness-heading">Check your assignment before Election Day</h2><p>The Ashtabula County Board of Elections report listed its polling-location data as updated October 16, 2026. This directory was checked October 18, 2026. Locations can change; the Ohio Secretary of State lookup is the authority for your own address and ballot.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="polling-explorer" aria-labelledby="polling-directory-heading">
    <div class="polling-directory-head">
      <div><p class="polling-eyebrow">{{ directory.locations.length }} polling locations · 104 precincts</p><h2 id="polling-directory-heading">Search the directory</h2><p>Search by polling place, street, community, or precinct name or number.</p></div>
      <a class="polling-source-link" href="{{ directory.sourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the county Board of Elections report <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <form class="polling-search" role="search" data-polling-search-form>
      <label for="polling-search-input">Polling place or precinct</label>
      <div class="polling-search-controls"><input id="polling-search-input" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Try “Geneva 3” or “44004”" aria-controls="polling-location-list" aria-describedby="polling-search-help"><button type="reset" class="polling-clear" data-polling-clear>Clear</button></div>
      <p id="polling-search-help">Your search is processed on this page and is not sent to a server.</p>
    </form>
    <p class="polling-result-count" data-polling-result-count role="status" aria-live="polite">Showing all {{ directory.locations.length }} polling locations.</p>

    <div class="polling-layout">
      <div class="polling-results" id="polling-location-list" aria-label="Polling locations">
        {% for location in directory.locations %}
          <article class="polling-location-card" data-polling-location data-search="{{ location.searchText }}">
            <div class="polling-card-top"><span class="polling-marker" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span><div><h3>{{ location.name }}</h3><address>{{ location.address.street }}<br>{{ location.address.city }}, {{ location.address.state }} {{ location.address.zip }}</address></div></div>
            <div class="polling-precinct-section"><h4>{{ location.precincts.length }} precinct{% if location.precincts.length != 1 %}s{% endif %} assigned here</h4><ul>{% for precinct in location.precincts %}<li><span>{{ precinct.name }}</span><button type="button" class="polling-map-button" data-precinct-name="{{ precinct.name }}" data-map-url="{{ precinct.mapUrl }}" aria-label="View dated official reference map for {{ precinct.name }}">Map PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
            <a class="polling-directions" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query={{ (location.address.street + ', ' + location.address.city + ', OH ' + location.address.zip) | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Directions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <aside class="polling-map-panel" aria-labelledby="polling-map-heading">
        <div class="polling-map-panel-head"><span class="polling-map-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div><h3 id="polling-map-heading">Official precinct map</h3><p data-polling-map-selection>Select a “Map PDF” beside a precinct to view its county reference map.</p></div></div>
        <div class="polling-map-warning"><strong>Historical map reference</strong><p>The linked Ashtabula County precinct map PDFs are dated February 27, 2013. They are not confirmed 2026 boundary maps. Use the official Ohio voter lookup to verify your current polling assignment.</p></div>
        <div class="polling-map-frame-wrap" data-polling-map-frame-wrap hidden><iframe title="Official Ashtabula County precinct reference map" data-polling-map-frame loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe></div>
        <a class="polling-map-open" data-polling-map-open href="https://www.boe.ohio.gov/ashtabula/c/precmap/001.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>Open selected precinct map PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <div class="polling-map-foot"><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span><p><strong>Precinct</strong> is your election district. Multiple precincts can vote at one building. This is different from early in-person voting, which uses a separate location.</p></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <p class="polling-no-results" data-polling-no-results hidden>No polling places match that search. Try a shorter street, community, or precinct name, or use the official voter lookup.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="polling-explain" aria-labelledby="polling-how-heading"><h2 id="polling-how-heading">How to use this directory</h2><div class="polling-explain-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Find your precinct</h3><p>Your precinct name is printed on your voter information and may be found through the official voter lookup.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>See its assigned location</h3><p>Search the precinct name or number above. The listed precinct-to-location assignment comes from the county Board of Elections report.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Verify before you go</h3><p>Election Day polling places and early-voting sites are different. Confirm the location for your own address and this election with Ohio’s official lookup.</p></article></div></section>
  <footer class="polling-data-citation"><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href="{{ directory.sourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ashtabula County Board of Elections precinct and polling-place report</a> (report updated October 16, 2026); <a href="https://voterlookup.ohiosos.gov/voterlookup.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ohio Secretary of State Voter Lookup</a>; <a href="https://www.boe.ohio.gov/ashtabula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ashtabula County Board of Elections</a>.</p><p>Assignments were transcribed from the county report and checked October 18, 2026. Official precinct map PDFs linked here show map creation date February 27, 2013. We did not find an official current-election polygon or coordinate dataset in the public sources reviewed. No current boundary overlay or address-to-precinct match is claimed.</p></footer>
</article>
<script defer src="{{ '/js/polling-places.js' | url }}?v=20261018-polling1"></script>
